{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 6, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "免", "id": "免"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "大王", "id": "大王"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "殘", "id": "殘"}, {"form": "毀", "id": "毀"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.194134355325648, "source": "行", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.5475071904005957, "source": "行", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.205735267004128, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.205735267004128, "source": "行", "target": "毀"}, {"weight": 1.8002701588959635, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.166546398806819, "source": "君", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 0.11672427430814139, "source": "君", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.6275498980741321, "source": "君", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.6275498980741321, "source": "君", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 3.672072335797555, "source": "免", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 3.0659365322272394, "source": "免", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.6796421711073488, "source": "人", "target": "毀"}, {"weight": 1.2741770629991844, "source": "人", "target": "殘"}, {"weight": 1.2741770629991844, "source": "人", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 0.07020425867324856, "source": "人", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.426879202611981, "source": "人", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 0.5810298824392391, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.8803128665695001, "source": "事", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.88361